{
  "title": "Ziyarat-e-Hazrat Imam-e-Zamana (a.t.f.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا صَاحِبَ الزَّمَانِ.  \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAAHEBAZ ZAMAAN. \nPeace be upon you O master of the times! \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا خَلِیْفَۃَ الرَّحْمٰنِ.  \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KHALEEFATAR RAHMAAN. \nPeace be upon you O Imam of men and jinn! \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا شَرِیْكَ القُرْآنِ.  \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SHAREEKAL QUR-AAN. \nPeace be upon you O companion of Qur’an! \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا مَوْلَانَا صَاحِبَ الْعَصْرِ وَ الزَّمَانِ.  \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MAWLAANA SAAHEBAL ASRE WAZ ZAMAAN. \nPeace be upon you O our master, master of the time and era! \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكُمْ وَ رَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ.\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM WA RAHMATUL LAHE WA BARAKAATOH.\nPeace be upon you and the mercy of Allah and his Bounties!"
}
